e the delivery of therapies to\npatients.\n\n[\nRead more\n][139]\n\n## Global recognition and awards\n\nToggle awards card detail view\n\n### A Leader in Reinvention\n\nOur Chair and CEO, Julie Sweet, is No. 11 on Fortune’s Most Powerful People in Business. Every day,\nJulie and our people demonstrate why Accenture is our clients’ reinvention partner of choice.\n\n[\nSee related awards\n][140]\nToggle awards card detail view\n\n### A Great Place To Work®\n\nWe are very proud to have earned the No. 4 spot on the Great Place To Work® list of the World’s Best\nWorkplaces™, our highest-ever ranking on this prestigious list.\n\nThis recognition is especially meaningful because it is based on feedback from our people worldwide.\n\n[\nSee related awards\n][141]\nToggle awards card detail view\n\n### A Trusted Industry Leader\n\nAccenture is a Leader in the 2025 Gartner Magic Quadrant for Public Cloud IT Transformation\nServices.\n\nAccenture placed highest on the Ability to Execute axis in the Magic Quadrant report, which assessed\na total of 15 PCITS providers.\n\n[\nSee related awards\n][142]\nCareers\n\n### Build a career that's as exciting as the world we're shaping\n\nGrow personally and professionally in a global company that helps you unlock your full potential.\n\n[\nJoin us\n][143]\nAccenture news\nPlay\nPause\n[\n\nJuly 15, 2026\n\n### Accenture Helps European Commission’s Directorate-General for International Partnerships to\n### Scale AI Across Global Operations\n\n][144]\n[\n\nJuly 7, 2026\n\n### NATO Announces Major Contract with Accenture to Help Advance Towards a More Agile and Resilient\n### Digital Infrastructure\n\n][145]\n[\n\nJune 29, 2026\n\n### ServiceNow and Accenture Launch AI-powered Services to Accelerate the Shift from Legacy Risk\n### Platforms to Agentic AI\n\n][146]\n[\n\nJune 30, 2026\n\n### Europe Accelerates in AI Race But a Growing Divide Threatens Progress\n\n][147]\n[\n\nJune 17, 2026\n\n### Accenture to Strengthen Capabilities for Software and Automation Solutions from Siemens Digital\n### Industries with Acquisition of Industries eXcellence Group\n\n][148]\n[\n\nJune 16, 2026\n\n### Unilever Scales Digital Twins Across Global Manufacturing Network with Accenture\n\n][149]\n[\n\nJune 8, 2026\n\n### Accenture and the Carnegie Mellon University Software Engineering Institute Launch AI Adoption\n### Maturity Model to Help Organizations Scale AI with Predictable Outcomes\n\n][150]\n[\n\nJune 23, 2026\n\n### Accenture Launches Accenture Edge to Help Mid-Market Companies Harness AI and Reinvent How They\n### Operate\n\n][151]\n\n## Like this content?\n\n### Stay ahead of change by downloading the Accenture Foresight App.\n\n## Let there be change\n* [Preference Center][152]\n* [Careers][153]\n* [About Us][154]\n* [Contact Us][155]\n* [Locations][156]\n* [Sitemap][157]\n* [Privacy Statement][158]\n* [Terms & Conditions][159]\n* [Cookie Policy/Settings][160]\n* [Accessibility Statement][161]\n\n© 2026 Accenture. All Rights Reserved.\n\n[1]: #main\n[2]: #footer\n[3]: /in-en\n[4]: /in-en\n[5]: /in-en/services\n[6]: /in-en/services/ai-data\n[7]: /in-en/services/cloud\n[8]: /in-en/services/customer-service\n[9]: /in-en/services/cybersecurity\n[10]: /in-en/services/digital-engineering-manufacturing\n[11]: /in-en/services/ecosystem-partners\n[12]: /in-en/services/emerging-technology\n[13]: /in-en/services/finance-risk\n[14]: /in-en/services/infrastructure-capital-projects\n[15]: /in-en/services/learning\n[16]: /in-en/services/managed-services\n[17]: /in-en/services/marketing-experience\n[18]: /in-en/services/metaverse\n[19]: /in-en/services/sales-commerce\n[20]: /in-en/services/strategy\n[21]: /in-en/services/supply-chain\n[22]: /in-en/services/sustainability\n[23]: /in-en/services/talent-organization\n[24]: /in-en/services/technology-transformation\n[25]: /in-en/industries/aerospace-defense\n[26]: /in-en/industries/automotive\n[27]: /in-en/industries/banking\n[28]: /in-en/industries/capital-markets\n[29]: /i