ology conferences. Access expertise in D&H specialist teams, solution architects,\npartner marketing, plus solutions and services. Experience, Education, & Expertise: The Keys to the\nD&H Advantage.\n\n# ** D&H is a leading technology distributor ** providing the latest solutions and services and\n# exceptional partner experiences to resellers and retailers throughout North America.\n\n[Group of professional shaking hands]\n\n## ** Partner With D&H **\n\nOur success is synonymous with your success. When you partner with D&H, you join a community built\non relationships, evolution, trust, and grit, harnessing more than a century of experience and\ndriven by a partner-first culture that prioritizes your growth.\n\n**[Sign Up Today to Become\na D&H Customer >>][37]**\n[OMNIA Partner Logo]\n\n## ** D&H and OMNIA Partnership **\n\nWith over 600,000 members from various public and non-profit sectors, OMNIA's cooperative purchasing\ncontracts are more accessible than ever and D&H is now offering our full solution portfolio under\nthis contract.\n\n**[Learn More About the D&H\nand OMNIA Partnership >>][38]**\n[D&H BFG: Built for Growth. Giving. Generations.]\n\n## ** D&H Prioritizes Partners **\n\nFor more than a century, D&H has always put our partners first. To support their future growth, we\nhave recently expanded our dedicated sales & support teams, broadened our communities, grown our\nsolutions portfolio, and invested in our finance, supply chain, and marketing agency services.\n\n**[Discover how D&H is Built for\nGrowth, Giving, and Generations >>][39]**\n\n## **Honoring the Life and Legacy of Izzy Schwab **\n\nD&H Distributing mourns the passing of Izzy Schwab, Chairman Emeritus and a lifelong steward of\nthe company.\n\nIzzy's leadership, humility, and belief in people helped shape D&H into what it is today, serving\npartners and communities across North America. His values continue to guide the teams at D&H.\nThose wishing to share a memory or reflection are invited to visit our digital tribute wall.\n\n[Visit Our Tribute Wall and Share Your Stories][40]\n\nIn lieu of flowers, the family has shared that those who wish to honor Izzy's memory may consider\na contribution to either of these two organizations, causes close to his heart.\n\nMake-A-Wish\nPhiladelphia, Delaware & Susquehanna Valley\n\n[Donate Here][41]\n\nHumane Society of Harrisburg Area/Central PA\n\n[Donate Here][42]\n\nThe family will be having a private funeral, however we also plan to host a Celebration of Life at a\nfuture date at D&H Headquarters that will be open to friends, partners, and members of the D&H\ncommunity. For those unable to attend in person, additional ways to participate or share\nsentiments will be made available.\n\n[memories]\n[Group of professionals gathered around laptop]\n\n## ** End-to-End Solutions **\n\nFind a wealth of technologies from leading brands across multiple applications for any client across\ncommercial and consumer markets in both the public and private sectors.\n\n[LEARN MORE][43]\n\n## ** Experience True Partnership **\n\nDiscover the advantage of a technology company focused on\ndelivering exceptional partner experiences and engagement backed\nby an expert team.\n\n[LEARN MORE][44]\n[Group of professionals reviewing work documents ]\n[[Work Hard Play Hard: Take a glimpse of videos showing our winning culture.]][45]\n[What's News at D&H]\n[\n[What's News this Month at D&H]\n\n## ** Watch July 2026**\n\n][46]\n\n### ** Here's What's News This Month at D&H **\n\n[Thread logo]\n\nJoin us in Hershey, PA for our **D&H THREAD Technology Conference!**\n\n[ Register Now ][47]\n[Frontier Logo]\n\nBecome a **Dell Frontier Partner** at D&H Now!\n\n[ Learn More ][48]\n[MKTShift logo]\n\nLeverage our library of **customizable marketing resources** now!\n\n[ Download Now ][49]\n[Solutions Lab Logo][DHTV Logo]\n\nWatch **webinars and in-depth technical trainings** on-demand now!\n\n[ D&HTV ][50][ Solutions Lab ][51]\n\n## D&H Suppo