n. With 24 monthly bill credits.  Get full terms\n[Front and back of Samsung Galaxy S26 Ultra with pen]\nNo trade-in needed\n[Front and back of Google Pixel 10 Pro.]\nGOOGLE\n\n## Pixel 10 Pro On Us on Experience Beyond.\n\n[ Shop now ][96]\n**Go5G Next members also qualify.** Via 24 monthly bill credits when you add a qualifying line. Get\nfull terms\nFAMILY FREEDOM\n\n## Switch and get up to $800/line to pay off your old phones.\n\n[ Check it out ][97]\n**When you trade & upgrade up to 4 phones.** Via virtual prepaid card. New device, qualifying\ncredit, service, eligible trade-in & port required. Card typically takes 15 days. Get full terms\n[Get up to $800 per line.]\nNo trade-in needed\nMOTOROLA\n\n## New motorola razr On Us. No trade-in needed.\n\n[ Shop now ][98]\nEndless ways to capture. Yours when you activate a new line on an Experience More plan. Via 24\nmonthly bill credits. Get full terms\n[Motorola razr in gray, shown open and closed with a large inner display and a compact outer\nscreen.]\nSAME-DAY INTERNET\n\n## Get the fastest 5G home internet delivered the same day with free DoorDash delivery.\n\n**Powered by DoorDash.**\n\n[ Learn more , opens in a new window ][99]\nSource: Fastest according to Ookla Speedtest Intelligence data, 2H 2025. All rights reserved.\nAvailable for most Internet-eligible customers, see if it’s an option during checkout. Get full\nterms\n[An image of a white T-Mobile 5G Gateway next to a DoorDash delivery bag.]\n\nIf you cancel entire account before receiving 24 credits, credits stop and balance on required\nfinance agreement is due; for phones, contact us. Bill credits end if you pay off device early. For\nwell-qualified customers, plus tax & $35 device connection charge.\n\n[ Shop all deals ][100]\n\n# Compare our most popular plans.\n\n[Experience Beyond plan]\n\n## $56.67/mo.\n\n**per phone line for 3 lines with AutoPay, plus taxes and fees. **\n\nUpgrade your phone every year and get the best entertainment bundle in wi