e\nof IT services.\n\n \n\n[**READ MORE**][155]\n[THE ECONOMICS OF AI: FROM BREAKTHROUGHS TO BUSINESS VALUE]\n\n## **WIPRO PRESENTS THE CO-INNOVATION CONCLAVE\n## WIPRO PARTNER DAY 2026, GURUGRAM**\n\nJoin Wipro at the **Co-Innovation Conclave,** powered by our partners—**Intel, IBM, HPE, Rubrik, BMC\n& SecPod.**\n\n[**READ MORE**][156]\n[WIPRO PRESENTS THE CO-INNOVATION CONCLAVE WIPRO PARTNER DAY 2026, GURUGRAM]\n\nState of Cybersecurity Report 2025\n\nAI Strengthens and Disrupts Cyber Resilience.\n\n[Learn More][157]\n\nCustomer\nSuccess Stories.\n\nHow Wipro uses consulting-led, AI-powered strategies to help customers realize their ambitions.\n\n[Learn More][158]\n[\n\n.\n\n][159]\n[\n\nWipro is proudly committed to achieving net-zero emissions by 2040 .\n\n][160]\n[\n\nIgnite Growth in Finance and Energy with Capco GenAI Solutions .\n\n][161]\n\nEvery day, Wipro leverages AI-infused technologies\nto empower clients around the globe to build\na more resilient, secure and sustainable future.\n\nHow can we help you?\n\n© 2026 Wipro\n* [Disclaimer][162]\n* [Privacy][163]\n* [Modern Slavery Statement][164]\n[ [Social media link] ][165] [ [Social media link] ][166] [ [Social media link] ][167] [ [Social\nmedia link] ][168]\nX\n[Share Icon]\n[popup-close-white.png]\n[popup-close.png]\n\n## Contact Wipro\n\n### Please fill the required details to access the content\n\n[loading.gif]\n\n[1]: #accessContent\n[2]: #accessNavigation\n[3]: #accessFooter\n[4]: #onetrust-banner-sdk\n[5]: /en/\n[6]: /applications/\n[7]: /wipro-intelligence/\n[8]: /business-process/\n[9]: /cloud/\n[10]: /consulting/\n[11]: /cybersecurity/\n[12]: /analytics/\n[13]: /digital/\n[14]: /engineering/\n[15]: /global-capability-centre/wipro-fusion-gcc/\n[16]: /sustainability/\n[17]: /banking/\n[18]: /capital-markets/\n[19]: /insurance/\n[20]: /communications/\n[21]: /new-age-media/\n[22]: /consumer-packaged-goods/\n[23]: /education/\n[24]: /professional-services/\n[25]: /public-sector/\n[26]: /retail/\n[