 more ][62]\n\nWe are enablers of the technology ecosystem and, according to our philosophy, any project\ncharacterized by technology must have a deep vocation for environmental and social sustainability.\n\nWe believe that new technologies represent a common good. That is why we are dedicated to being the\npoint of reference among the communities of technology manufacturers, retailers, and users.\n\nManufacturers\n\nWe work with more than 850 vendors, supplying their technologies to more than 30,000 business\nvendors and consumers.\n\n[ Find out more ][63]\n\nVendor\n\nBeing part of our network also means having a precise and clear view of the technology world's\ntrends and progress.\n\n[ Find out more ][64]\n\nUsers\n\nOur experience in the market and our extensive network enable us to stimulate the implementation of\ntechnological innovations in business processes by directing companies, but also private users, to\nthe most suitable resellers.\n\n[ Find out more ][65]\n\n## Esprinet News\n\n[ Read all the updates ][66]\nIn evidence\nEsprinet Board of Directors approves Group financial results as of 31 March 2026. The first quarter\nof the year shows growth and the ability to consistently generate value\nThe Board of Directors of ESPRINET has approved the Additional Periodic Financial Information as of\n31 March 2026, prepared in accordance with IFRS international accounting standards.\n[Learn more][67]\n13/05/2026\nV-Valley\nV-VALLEY BRINGS STORONE’S 9X FLASH STORAGE TECHNOLOGY TO ITALY THROUGH A STRATEGIC DISTRIBUTION\nAGREEMENT\n**V-Valley** announces the partnership with **StorONE**, a leader in Real-Time Tiering (RTT)\ntechnology.\n[Learn more][68]\n15/07/2026\nEsprinet joins the Intermonte Valore Italia Index\nEsprinet Group is proud to announce that it has been selected as one of the 100 companies listed on\nthe Borsa Italiana that make up the Intermonte Valore Italia Index.\n[Learn more][69]\n02/07/2026\nEsprinet and Dectar strengthen Italy’s digital Sover