ulptures capable of\nconverting solar energy into services for residential, business and urban environments.\n[Learn more][76]\n02/03/2026\nESPRINET\nEsprinet strengthens strategic Microsoft partnership across Southern Europe\nEsprinet is proud to announce that it has been selected by Microsoft as the new exclusive\ndistribution partner for Xbox Software & Accessories across Spain and Portugal.\n[Learn more][77]\n29/01/2026\n\n## Insights from the world of technology\n\n[ Read Our Blog ][78]\n[ [Immagine per: Operating leases: benefits for companies and professionals] ][79]\n[Operational Rental][80]\n[\n\n#### Operating leases: benefits for companies and professionals\n\n][81]\nAn operating lease, also called renting of instrumental assets, consists in renting an asset or a\nservice which remains the property of the leasing company, and which the purchaser can use for the\ntimes and in the ways established by a contract.\n[# Insights][82]\n[Read more][83]\n15/12/2022\n4 minutes of reading\n[ [Immagine per: Cash & Carry: how it works and which one to choose] ][84]\n[Esprivillage][85]\n[\n\n#### Cash & Carry: how it works and which one to choose\n\n][86]\nIn this article, we will see how the Cash & Carry formula works, and how important it is to choose\nthe best supplier of this kind of service.\n[# Insights][87]\n[Read more][88]\n15/12/2022\n6 minutes of reading\n[ [Immagine per: Corporate Cyber Security? On cloud vs on Premise] ][89]\n[Cyber Security][90]\n[\n\n#### Corporate Cyber Security? On cloud vs on Premise\n\n][91]\nCorporate data security is a dominant topic in the modern business world. Increasingly computerized\nand interconnected companies need systems to defend their computers, servers, mobile devices,\nelectronic systems, networks and data against malicious attacks.\n[# Insights][92]\n[Read more][93]\n02/12/2022\n10 minutes of reading\n[ [Immagine per: Waste at the office: how to be more sustainable] ][94]\n[Ecology][95]\n[\n\n#### Waste at the office: