          "summary": "[fbpx]\nHoliday Closure Announcement: Our offices and warehouses will be closed from 24th December 2025,\nre-opening on 5th January 2026.\n* [About][1]\n* Solutions\n  * [Business Applications][2]\n  * [Business Continuity & Disaster Recovery][3]\n  * [Computers, Servers & Hardware][4]\n  * [Data Management][5]\n  * [Enterprise][6]\n  * [IoT][7]\n  * [IT Management & Operations][8]\n  * [MSP Applications][9]\n  * [Networking Infrastucture & WiFi][10]\n  * [Security][11]\n  * [Storage][12]\n  * [Surveillance – Electronic Security][13]\n  * [Unified Communications & Collaboration][14]\n  * [Uninterruptible Power Supply (UPS)][15]\n* Services\n  * [Presales & Solution Architecture][16]\n  * [Training & Enablement][17]\n* [Vendors][18]\n* [Blogs][19]\n* [News][20]\n* [Contact][21]\n[Online Store][22]\n[bShop][23][bMarket][24]\n* [Blog][25]\n[Online Store][26]\nHero Slider\nHelping your business grow\n\nWe provide turnkey solutions from consulting, procuring, training and right down to deployment of a\nproject. This allows us to support and contribute to our resellers growth.\n\n[\nPartner with us\n][27]\nBluechip UC\nBluechip IT\nUnified Communications\n\nExpand your communications portfolio with Bluechip Infotech.\n\n[\nLearn More\n][28]\nBluechip IT ESI News\nBluechip IT\nElectronic Security Portfolio\n\nExpand your security portfolio with Bluechip Infotech.\n\n[\nLearn More\n][29]\nMSP\nBluechip MSP Portfolio\n\nEmpowering MSPs expand their business.\n\n[\nLearn More\n][30]\nHardware\nHardware\n\nAustralia's Leading brands distributor in the latest hardware and technology.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][31]\nSolutions\nSolutions\n\nDiscover endless specialist solutions with innovative products and designs.\n\n[\nLearn more\n][32]\n\n### Why Bluechip\n\nBluechip thrives with solutions and technology in Australia & New Zealand, providing leading\nbusiness solutions for our value-added resellers, managed service providers, integrators and\nconsultants.\n\nOur