t Us][81]\n  * [BBBEE Queries][82]\n  * [Branches and Service Centres][83]\n  * [Customer Care][84]\n  * [POPI Queries][85]\n  * [Sales Queries][86]\n  * [Technical Queries][87]\n  * [Blow the Whistle][88]\n* [ Search ][89]\nHolistic Solutions Mustek's diverse product portfolio, value-added services, and industry-leading\nlogistics capabilities will enable it to provide its resellers and partners with comprehensive\ntechnology solutions tailored to their needs. Powering SA South Africa’s most loved and trusted\nvalue-add technology distributor. Customer Delight Mustek aims to be the most loved and trusted\ntechnology distributor by consistently delivering exceptional customer experiences, reliable\nservices, and value-added support to its resellers and partners. Trusted Partnerships By maintaining\nhigh standards of governance, compliance, and transparency, Mustek will build strong, long-lasting\nrelationships with its customers based on trust and reliability. Comprehensive Solutions Mustek's\ndiverse product portfolio, value-added services, and industry-leading logistics capabilities will\nenable it to provide its resellers and partners with comprehensive technology solutions tailored to\ntheir needs.\n\n# Beyond ICT\n\nWe provide dynamic and innovative technology products and solutions from software and cloud licences\nto networking, data centre solutions, surveillance, data storage and cloud computing. Our services\nconsist of distribution, technical support, assembly, repairs and financing for our partner base.\n\nWith 35 years of experience, we have earned a solid understanding of the market challenges and\nrequirements. These insights allow us to offer a range of products and services in line with\nshifting needs and trends. Our aim is to empower our partners’ businesses that they are able to\nthrive and grow.\n\n## We are flexible, client-focused and reliable\n\nOur approach is to deliver service excellence, and to assist our partners in developing their\nbusinesses. Our open-door policy and ‘can-do-entrepreneurial spirit’ makes us easy to work with. We\npartner with tier 1 vendors to provide only the best solutions for the channel.\nBased in South Africa, we have a broad national footprint and the ability to service resellers and\nretailers across Southern Africa.\n\nWe have branches nationally across all provinces.\n\n## Featured Brands\n\n[All Brands][90]\n\n### Business Pillars                         1/5\n\n## Edge Computing\n\nEdge computing is ushering in a new world of technological innovation, altering the way we live,\nwork and communicate. Edge computing delivers ultra-low latency and high-quality solutions that meet\nconsumer demand for real-time information and content.\n\n[Learn More][91]\n\n### Business Pillars                         2/5\n\n## Software and Cloud\n\nWith the rise of cloud computing, software licensing began to change mostly due to the very nature\nof working online and to drive adoption of products on a daily basis. While the seat license model\nis slowly transition (mostly due to volume discounts), many companies are actively moving towards\nCloud licensing to capture new market share.\n\n[Learn More][92]\n\n### Business Pillars                         3/5\n\n## Network Infrastructure\n\nNetwork infrastructure is the hardware and software resources of an entire network that enable\nnetwork connectivity, communication, operations and management of an enterprise network. It provides\nthe communication path and services between users, processes, applications, services and external\nnetworks/the internet.\n\n[Learn More][93]\n\n### Business Pillars                         4/5\n\n## Security and Compliance\n\nIn today’s modern workplace, it’s essential for security and compliance teams to know the full\ncapabilities of productivity, collaboration and communication platforms in order to define a\ncoherent digital strategy and to keep your business safe\n\n[Learn More][94]\n\n### Business Pillars                       5/5\n\n## Training and Enablement\n\nOur partners are provided with ongoing training and development, through Mecer Inter-Ed our internal\nTraining academy as well as ongoing additional webinars, educational content providing continuous\nsupport and assistance, helping to ensure your success.\n\n[Learn More][95]\n\n# Living our valuesfrom start to finish\n\nOur Values drive every decision we make.\n\n## Efficiency\n\nMustek strives for efficiency which enables the Group to do more with less and in doing so ensures\nquick response times for its customers, whether these are stock turnaround times or the time taken\nto repair or replace a piece of hardware.\n\n## Flexibility\n\nIn a constantly changing IT landscape, Mustek believes that business flexibility is vital to\nsuccess. At Mustek, we have a “can do” attitude that gives us the ability to make whatever\noperational or product changes are necessary to respond effectively to trends or opportunities. This\nculture of flexibility allows Mustek to quickly onboard products or rearrange the assembly line to\noffer new lines or quickly meet customers’ changing requirements. Mustek’s staff are both able and\neager to seek innovative solutions to new challenges.\n\n## Responsibility and Accountability\n\nMustek believes in integrity, employment equity, care for the environment, respect and human dignity\nfor all. We reward performance and share responsibility at all levels.\n\n## Press Centre\n\n[News][96]\n[Reports][97]\n[Media/Press][98]\n\n### A word from Acer\n\nSay hello to the all-new 14” pick-up-and-go. Bringing heavyweight performance within a color-washed\nlightweight shell, so you can make magic whenever, wherever—featuring 12th Gen Intel® Core™\nprocessors optimized for multitasking and a QHD or FHD touch display that is as bright as it is\nbrilliant.\n\n[Watch Video][99]\n\n### Mustek Solar Roof Project\n\nMustek  is running one of the biggest solar energy projects in South Africa, saving up to R80,000 in\nelectricity per month. Talk Radio 702’s Aki Anastasiou visited Mustek to find out more.\n\n[Watch the Video][100]\nSouth Africa’s most loved and trusted value-add technology distributor.\n\n## Company\n\n[Corporate Profile][101]\n\n[Why Mustek][102]\n\n[Board of Directors][103]\n\n[Group Structure][104]\n\n## Solutions\n\n[Distribution][105]\n\n[Mustek Energy][106]\n\n[Mustek POS][107]\n\n[Training and Enablement][108]\n\n## Brands\n\n[Edge][109]\n\n[Cloud and Software][110]\n\n[Networking][111]\n\n## Contact Us\n\n[Customer Care][112]\n\n[Branches][113]\n\n[POPI Queries][114]\n\n[Dealer Enquiries][115]\n\n© 2026 Mustek. All rights reserved.\nBuilt and maintained by [Chronon][116]\n\nWe take your privacy seriously.For more information visit our Privacy Page.\n\nPrivacy Preferences\nI Agree\n\n### Privacy Preference Center\n\n#### Privacy Preferences\n\nPrivacy\n\nWe take your privacy seriously. For more information visit our Privacy Page.\n[Privacy Policy][117]\n\n[1]: https://mustek.co.za/\n[2]: https://mustek.co.za/company/\n[3]: http://mustek.co.za/company/#profile\n[4]: http://mustek.co.za/company/#why\n[5]: http://mustek.co.za/company/#financials\n[6]: http://mustek.co.za/company/#board\n[7]: http://mustek.co.za/company/#structure\n[8]: http://mustek.co.za/company/#docs\n[9]: https://mustek.co.za/investor/\n[10]: /investor/#reports\n[11]: /investor/#news\n[12]: /all-brands/\n[13]: https://mustek.co.za/all-brands/\n[14]: https://mustek.co.za/edge-2/\n[15]: https://mustek.co.za/mecer-edge/\n[16]: https://mustek.co.za/acer/\n[17]: https://mustek.co.za/asus/\n[18]: https://mustek.co.za/apple-business-manager/\n[19]: https://mustek.co.za/brother/\n[20]: https://mustek.co.za/epson/\n[21]: https://mustek.co.za/ricoh/\n[22]: https://mustek.co.za/huawei/\n[23]: https://mustek.co.za/lenovo/\n[24]: https://mustek.co.za/logitech/\n[25]: https://mustek.co.za/msi/\n[26]: https://mustek.co.za/ncomputing/\n[27]: https://mustek.co.za/rapoo/\n[28]: https://