cting people, spaces, and technology through enterprise-grade ProAV solutions.\n\n[Discover ProAV ][104]\n\n## First Choice for IT®\n\nIT services. IT solutions. IT management tools.\n\n[CONSIDER THIS ][105]\n\n## Where IT Expertise Meets AV Innovation\n\nConnecting people, spaces, and technology through enterprise-grade ProAV solutions.\n\n[Discover ProAV ][106]\n[ [Microsoft 365 E7: The Frontier Suite] ][107]\n[ [Power Your Business Forward with Lenovo ThinkPad and AMD] ][108]\n[ [Microsoft: Modernize your security ops] ][109]\n[ [Apple iPad Pro M5] ][110]\n[ Previous ][111] [ Next ][112]\n[\n\n###### IT Services\n\nOptimize and grow your operations with our professional, managed, and strategic staffing services.\n][113]\n[\n\n###### Microsoft 365 E7: The Frontier Suite\n\nOne platform for secure productivity, AI built for work and control plane for agents.\n][114]\n[\n\n###### IT Management Tools\n\nDeveloped by Zones, these powerful digital tools simplify IT management for our customers.\n][115]\n\n## Whatever you need, wherever you are.\n\nZones takes a human approach to technology – because to us, IT should always be personal. You'll\nhave an expert advisor you can trust to champion your success. And you'll find us notoriously nimble\nand future-focused, with a singular mindset: Solve your complex IT problems TODAY with complete\nsolutions that can transition TOMORROW.\n\n## 15,000\n\nHappy Customers\n\n## 3,300\n\nBrand Partnerships\n\n## 35\n\nYears in Business\n\n## 100\n\nCountries Served\n\n> \"Zones did the job of knowing our business and presented solutions that fit our model well… They\n> got the right product we needed, co-termed our licensing, and also had the logistics to hit all\n> our locations nationwide.\"\n> \n> — Brian Berg\n> CIO, Morgan Services\n\n> \"I've never worked with a company that took care of their clients like Zones does. They diligently\n> collected data and had projections and examples every step of the way.\"\n> \n> — Director of IT\n> Gas and Electric Utility Company\n\n> \"Zones has so much more to offer compared to other solutions providers. The degree of\n> customization they offer means that the solution they provided us with is a perfect fit for our\n> needs.\"\n> \n> — Chief Information Officer\n> Auto Service Business\n\n> \"We were growing rapidly and needed to overhaul our network with as little downtime as possible.\n> We were surprised when Zones told us they could design a modern virtualized environment that could\n> scale at the rate we needed, but they implemented a solution that proved all their claims and\n> more.\"\n> \n> — IT Director\n> Insurance Brokerage\n\n> \"Zones' kiosk solution completely transformed the way we do business. Customers appreciate the\n> quick and painless option for placing their orders.\"\n> \n> — Director of Innovation\n> American Bakery-Caf� Chain\n\n> \"We were impressed by how thorough Zones' methodology was. They carefully considered our needs and\n> designed a SIEM solution that took those needs into account. This solution has improved our\n> security posture and gives us the visibility we need.\"\n> \n> — Director of Security\n> Non-Profit Medical System\n\n> \"Before contacting Zones, we knew how important a truly global supply chain was to a company of\n> our size – but we didn't realize how investing in supply chain improvements could transform our\n> business so completely. We're running at a completely different level thanks to Zones' solutions.\"\n> \n> — Director of IT\n> Global Semiconductor Manufacturer\n\n> \"We had entered into a really exciting growth period, but our vision exceeded our means, and we\n> needed a partner to help us achieve everything we wanted to. Not only did Zones really speed up\n> our processes, but they worked closely with our team to make sure we had the tools and experience\n> we needed to keep it up.\"\n> \n> — Director of IT\n> United States Auto Services Company\n\n> \"By leveraging Zones' Micro-Consulting Services, we could get the support we needed without having\n> to worry about overspending for services we didn't need.\"\n> \n> — County Department of IT\n\n> \"Zones is a longtime partner ... so when we needed expert help to simplify our deployment process,\n> I knew they would be the right fit for the job. Zones' team demonstrated exceptional knowledge and\n> expertise through every stage of the deployment and helped our teams to align critical\n> infrastructure without any major disruptions to our operations.\"\n> \n> — IT Director\n> Global IT and Security Company\n\n## Zones IT Innovation Center\n\nJoin our collaborative ecosystem and thought leadership community for IT professionals.\n\nKnow how Zones Innovation Center gives organizations a head start on the adoption of new services\nand technologies.\n\nRead white paper.\n\n[ESG Showcase Zones Innovation Center][116]\n\nConnect.\n\nCollaborate.\n\nExplore.\n\nExperiment.\n\n[Tell me more ][117]\n\n## IT Practices\n\n[\n\n##### Practice\n\n#### Cloud & Data Center\n\nStore, scale and safeguard your information and achieve greater organizational agility at the same\ntime. Enterprise tools are rapidly going online. And with over 85% of organizations planning to\nadopt a multi-cloud strategy, most businesses simply cannot afford to stick to legacy\ntelecommunications and storage practices.\n][118]\n[\n\n##### Practice\n\n#### Networking\n\nWired. Wireless. In house or in the cloud. Streamline your networks for the connectivity you need.\n][119]\n[\n\n##### Practice\n\n#### Digital Workplace\n\nCreate a workplace that inspires productivity, collaboration and growth – all while lowering costs.\n][120]\n[\n\n##### Practice\n\n#### Security\n\nSafeguard your data with solutions and services for your data center, networks, end points, and the\ncloud.\n][121]\n\n## Featured Solutions Partners\n\nZones' strategic partnerships with top-tier technology companies ensure you won't get any\ncookie-cutter solutions from us.\n\n## Empower your people and your mission with Zones Digital Workplace.\n\nTake advantage of tremendous savings on products that help scale your business.\n\n[Shop All Products ][122]\n[\n\n#### Desktops & Workstations\n\nA new generation of performance\n][123]\n[\n\n#### Monitors & Projectors\n\nA new level of display performance\n][124]\n[\n\n#### Notebooks & Tablets\n\nEnable business as usual, everywhere\n][125]\n[\n\n#### Servers\n\nAccelerate workloads with innovation\n][126]\n[\n\n#### Storage & Backup\n\nTackle data growth\n][127]\n[\n\n#### Software\n\nMake software decisions with confidence\n][128]\n[\n\n#### Printers, Scanners & Supplies\n\nMove forward with world-class technology\n][129]\n[\n\n#### Networking\n\nMake confident infrastructure decisions\n][130]\n[\n\n#### Memory\n\nYour environments, running at top speed\n][131]\n[\n\n#### Cables\n\nMaintain a reliable, available data center\n][132]\n[\n\n#### Power Protection\n\nKeep your organization running\n][133]\n[\n\n#### Accessories\n\nExpand the possibilities of computing\n][134]\n[\n\n#### Electronics\n\nService and an unbeatable selection\n][135]\n\n## Zones - First Choice for IT^{�}\n\nLet us show you what technology makes possible – and then help you make it happen.\n\n[CONSIDER MORE ][136]\n[ [Footer Zones logo] ][137]\n\nFirst Choice for IT^{�}\n\nZones is a global solutions provider of end-to-end IT solutions with an unmatched supply chain.\n\n[Contact Us][138]\n[800.408.9663][139] [customerservice@zones.com][140]\n[ [zones careers] ][141]\n[ [Join the Zones IT Solutions Community on LinkedIn!] ][142]\n[Services and Solutions][143]\n[Cloud and Data Center][144] [Networking][145] [Digital Workplace][146] [Security][147] [IT\nLifecycle Services][148]\n[About Us][149]\n[Why Zones][150] [Career Opportunities][151] [Corporate Social Responsibility][152] [Financing][153]\n[Sustainability][154]\n[IT Management Tools][155]\n[eCommerce Solutions][156] [myZones][157] [ZonesCloud^{®} Commerce][1